## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

### Hardware
- **STM32 Nucleo-64 C031C6** — Main microcontroller development board
- **Red LED** — LED sequence indication
- **Green LED** — LED sequence indication
- **220Ω Resistors** — LED current limiting
- **16×2 I²C LCD** — Displays project status messages
- **Push Buttons (2)** — LCD ON and LCD OFF control
- **Mini Breadboard** — Circuit prototyping and component connections

### Software & Development Tools
- **C/C++** — Embedded application programming
- **FreeRTOS** — Real-time operating system used for multi-tasking
- **STM32 Arduino Framework** — Microcontroller programming framework
- **PlatformIO** — Project configuration, library management, building, and firmware compilation
- **VS Code** — Development environment
- **Wokwi** — Online circuit design and STM32 simulation

### Libraries
- **STM32duino FreeRTOS** — FreeRTOS support for the STM32 Arduino framework
- **LiquidCrystal_I2C** — Library for controlling the I²C LCD

### Communication & Concepts
- **I²C Communication** — Communication between the STM32 and LCD
- **GPIO** — Digital LED and push-button control
- **FreeRTOS Tasks** — Independent LED and LCD control tasks
- **Task Scheduling** — Concurrent execution of multiple tasks
- **`vTaskDelay()`** — Timing and task blocking within FreeRTOS
- **Internal Pull-Up Resistors** — Push-button input handling
